WEBVTT

00:02:56.818 --> 00:03:02.998
kuzatilgan va koinot yaralishining 
alomati hisoblangan

00:03:02.998 --> 00:03:07.890
kosmik mikroto'lqinli fon bilan 
muvofiq keladi.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:12.258
O'ylashimizcha, biz olam yaralishi 
sirini ochdik.

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:14.798
Ehtimol, koinotni patentlashimiz va
barchadan ularning

00:03:14.798 --> 00:03:21.404
mavjudligi uchun mualliflik qalam haqi 
undirishimiz kerakdir.

00:03:21.404 --> 00:03:24.394
Endi ikkinchi muhim savolga 
to'xtalib o'tsam:

00:03:24.394 --> 00:03:32.041
biz koinotda yolg'izmizmi yoki unda
boshqa hayot shakllari ham mavjudmi?